The Noto animation files used by this package are not modified. The package
selects their playback frame and scales their display without rewriting the
source artwork. No endorsement by Google is implied.

Artwork is bundled as an immutable local snapshot of Google's official JSON
files. assets/noto/manifest.json records each source URL, byte size and SHA-256.
There is no runtime CDN fallback. No Noto GIF files are redistributed.

