The generated Dart catalog is a derived subset of Google's metadata: animated
entries and their alternates are selected, categories are combined, and names
and keywords are formed from shortcodes, emoticons and Unicode skin tones.
Artwork bytes are unchanged. No endorsement by Google is implied.

